        "answer": {
          "short": "$x$-intercept: $14$; $y$-intercept: $-6$.",
          "worked": "For the $x$-intercept, set $y=0$.\n$$\\begin{align*}3x-42&=0\\\\3x&=42\\\\x&=14\\end{align*}$$\nFor the $y$-intercept, set $x=0$.\n$$\\begin{align*}-7y-42&=0\\\\-7y&=42\\\\y&=-6\\end{align*}$$",
